OAB - The occurrence of peak demand events during soccer matches is infrequent. 
      Therefore, understanding the frequency of efforts below the intensity threshold 
      of the most demanding passages for each playing position and across various 
      analysed variables and periods is of utmost importance.MDS might not be enough 
      for effective soccer training planning. Complementing with additional metrics 
      like GPS, tactical analysis, physiological data and psychological factors is 
      essential for a comprehensive understanding of the game’s demands and tailored 
      training programmes.
