TI  - QT interval and QT dispersion in endurance athletes and in power athletes using 
      large doses of anabolic steroids.
PG  - 364-6, A9
AB  - We measured electrocardiographic repolarization indexes in athletes. Physiologic 
      adaptive cardiac hypertrophy did not increase QT dispersion in endurance athletes 
      despite long QT intervals due to increased vagal tone. In contrast, power 
      athletes taking large doses of anabolic steroids had increased QT dispersion 
      despite short QT intervals, which seems to reflect altered myocardium in the 
      hypertrophied heart.
